{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T07:37:53+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-29T07:37:53+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Visa Inc.","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Credit Services","country":"United States","city":"San Francisco","website":"https://www.visa.com","employees":34100,"summary":"Visa Inc. operates as a payment technology company in the United States and internationally. The company operates VisaNet, a transaction processing network that enables authorization, clearing, and settlement of payment transactions. It also offers credit, debit, and prepaid card products; tap to pay, tokenization, and click to pay services; Visa Direct, a platform which facilitates money movement, enabling clients to collect, hold, convert, and send funds across its network; and issuing solutions, such as airport lounge access, dining reservations, shopping experiences, event tickets, and seller offers. In addition, the company provides acceptance solutions, an omnichannel payment integration with e-commerce platforms; risk detection and prevention solutions; and advisory and other services comprising consulting practice, proprietary analytics models, data scientists and economists, marketing services, and managed services. It provides its services under the Visa, Visa Electron, V PAY, Interlink, and PLUS brands. The company serves consumers, sellers, financial institutions, and government entities. Visa Inc. was founded in 1958 and is headquartered in San Francisco, California.","exchange":"NYSE","currency":"USD","financial_currency":"USD","summary_fr":"Visa Inc. opère en tant que société de technologie de paiement aux États-Unis et à l'étranger. La société exploite VisaNet, un réseau de traitement des transactions qui permet l'autorisation, la compensation et le règlement des transactions de paiement. Il propose également des produits de carte de crédit, de débit et prépayés; tap to pay, tokenization, and click to pay services; Visa Direct, une plate-forme qui facilite le mouvement de l'argent, permettant aux clients de collecter, détenir, convertir et envoyer des fonds à travers son réseau; et des solutions d'émission, telles que l'accès aux salons d'aéroport, les réservations de restaurants, les expériences de magasinage, les billets d'événements et les offres des vendeurs. En outre, la société fournit des solutions d'acceptation, une intégration de paiement omnicanal avec les plates-formes de commerce électronique; solutions de détection et de prévention des risques; et des services de conseil et autres comprenant des pratiques de conseil, des modèles d'analyse exclusifs, des scientifiques et des économistes de données, des services de marketing et des services gérés. Elle fournit ses services sous les marques Visa, Visa Electron, V PAY, Interlink et PLUS. La société sert les consommateurs, les vendeurs, les institutions financières et les entités gouvernementales. Visa Inc. a été fondée en 1958 et a son siège social à San Francisco, en Californie."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":752068526080,"shares_outstanding":1704112694,"trailing_pe":32.516235,"forward_pe":23.36919,"price_to_book":21.229464,"ev_to_ebitda":24.094,"ev_to_revenue":16.84,"dividend_yield":0.0066000004,"payout_ratio":0.22129999,"beta_yahoo":0.771},"targets":{"current_price":400.6,"mean":437.06433,"median":440.0,"high":485.0,"low":330.0,"n_analysts":37,"reco_mean":1.45,"reco_key":"strong_buy"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2027-01-26"],"eps_avg":3.63021,"eps_low":3.58,"eps_high":3.75,"revenue_avg":12205829340,"ex_dividend":"2026-08-11","dividend_date":"2026-09-01"},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.00085,"institutions_pct":0.90042996,"institutions_float_pct":0.90120006,"institutions_n":5981,"institutions":[{"name":"Blackrock Inc.","pct":0.0808,"shares":137669061,"value":55150226676,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.0109},{"name":"Vanguard Capital Management LLC","p